        "T[O(t+1)] = (1-p) S_kappa[O(t)] + p C_gamma[O(t)]",
        "lambda_n = (1-p) e^{n kappa} + p e^{-n gamma}",
        "p_n_star = (e^{n kappa} - 1)/(e^{n kappa} - e^{-n gamma})"
